      "text": "The source study describes humanized anti-CD3 HCAbs tested in plate-immobilized-antibody Jurkat activation and flow-cytometry binding assays. The variable-domain sequence is supplied for each candidate. Binding is reported as Jurkat CD3-positive fluorescence intensity (MFI); no CD3-negative measurement is supplied. The activation endpoint is IL-2 concentration in pg/mL. The humanized HCAbs were yeast-produced. The exact antibody coating concentration is not reported in the source. Predict the withheld IL-2 response under this source-described assay; this endpoint does not represent soluble-antibody autonomous activation or a clinical cytokine-release estimate.",
